### Create a new game with a specific mode
POST  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"players": [1, 2],
"mode": "rapide",
"difficulty": 2
}

### get a game
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games/5 HTTP/1.1

### update a game
PUT  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games/4 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"local_players": ["me", "bob"]
}

